[[2047,31,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the signal for\nactivating the rear fog lamps to the check device inside the rev\ncounter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 1 of connector \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>The supply for the check device inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives\ndirectly from the battery (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) at\npins 10 and 16 of connector A, through fuses \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe junction unit\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ; the former protects the circuits for\nthe lights on the left hand side, the latter those on the right.\nthe former protects the circuits for the lights on the left hand\nside, the latter those on the right.</p><p>The check device only controls (pin 4 and\npin 17 of connector A) the supply of the rear fog lamps in the centre\nrear light clusters on the left \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and the right \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F36</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               if\none of the two go ahead signals arrives from the dipped beam headlamps\nor the front ghts.</p><p>The first signal arrives from the dipped\nbeam headlamps circuit at pin 8 of connector A (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233782\">E2011</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>The second signal is supplied by the circuit\ninside the module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : it is the same signal which lights\nup the &quot;front fog lights on&quot; warning light.</p><p>At the same time as the lights are switched\non, the &quot;rear fog lamps on&quot; warning light - inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               -\nis also switched on with pin 14 of connector A providing the earth.</p><p>In the case of failures in the circuit,\nthe &quot;lights failure&quot; warning light - inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               -\ncomes on, with the supply controlled by the ignition (IINT), pin\n15 of connector A, of the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the\nadditional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is lit up when the\nside lights are switched on by means of the line coming from the\nswitch for the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]